		sections={
			{id=12331,title="Overview",body="Odyn challenges players to honorable combat. When a player would die, they are instead removed from the fight by Odyn's val'kyr. Upon being reduced to 80% of his life, Odyn is convince of players' worth and ends the fight."},
			{id=12332,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;When affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197961|h[Runic Brand]|h|r look at the floor and run to the matching rune.\n$bullet;Avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198072|h[Spear of Light]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198088|h[Glowing Fragments]|h|r.\n$bullet;Run away from Odyn to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198263|h[Radiant Tempest]|h|r."},
