			{itemID=134519,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=136720,diffs={1,2,23},faction=-1},
			{itemID=136724,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=134412,diffs={1,2,23,24},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=12273,title="Overview",body="Illysanna fights players on the ground as her Fury bar builds. When it fills, she leaps into the air and unleashes deadly eye beams as she calls her risen guards to dispatch the party. Each eye beam partially depletes her Fury, and when she can no longer use eye beams to attack the party, she lands, re-engaging on the ground."},
			{id=12274,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Players targeted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197478|h[Dark Rush]|h|r should gather together to minimize the amount of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197821|h[Felblazed Ground]|h|r.\n$bullet;Otherwise, players should spread to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197546|h[Brutal Glaive]|h|r bouncing to them.\n$bullet;Interrupt Risen Arcanists' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197797|h[Arcane Blitz]|h|r."},
			{id=12275,title="Healer",body="$bullet;Players targeted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197478|h[Dark Rush]|h|r should gather together together to minimize the amount of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197821|h[Felblazed Ground]|h|r.\n$bullet;Otherwise, players should spread to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197546|h[Brutal Glaive]|h|r bouncing to them.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:197418|h[Vengeful Shear]|h|r deals heavy damage to tanks."},
			{id=12276,title="Tank",body="$bullet;Use defensive abilities for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197418|h[Vengeful Shear]|h|r to reduce damage taken.\n$bullet;Avoid Risen Vanguard's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:197974|h[Bonecrushing Strike]|h|r."},
			{id=12277,title="Stage One: Vengeance"},
