		sections={
			{id=12313,title="Overview",body="The Shade of Xavius, a shadowy reflection of Xavius's true power, sits in the hollowed-out core of Shaladrassil tormenting Malfurion. At 50% health, the Shade of Xavius casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:200050|h[Apocalyptic Nightmare]|h|r in an attempt to burn Shaladrassil down around him."},
			{id=13317,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;If affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:200359|h[Induced Paranoia]|h|r, stay away from other players to keep them from taking damage and being feared.\n$bullet;If affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:200243|h[Waking Nightmare]|h|r, stand near other players to remove the Silence and Pacify.",difficultyIDs={2,8,23,24}},
			{id=13318,title="Healers",body="$bullet;If affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:200359|h[Induced Paranoia]|h|r, stay away from other players to keep them from taking damage and being feared.\n$bullet;If affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:200243|h[Waking Nightmare]|h|r, stand near other players to remove the Silence and Pacify .",difficultyIDs={2,8,23,24}},
