			{itemID=134507,diffs={1,2,23,24},faction=-1},
			{itemID=136715,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=12376,title="Overview",body="Smashspite engages players on the ground with heavy physical attacks, periodically calling in felbats to cover the ground in deadly Fel Vomit."},
			{id=12377,title="Tank",body="$bullet;Minimize damage taken by Smashspite's melee attacks to slow the rate at which his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198114|h[Brutality]|h|r bar fills.\n$bullet;When Smashspite's Brutality bar fills, he will use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198245|h[Brutal Haymaker]|h|r, inflicting heavy damage and increasing damage taken for a short time.\n$bullet;Stand between Smashspite and his target to intercept |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198080|h[Hateful Charge]|h|r if they have the debuff from intercepting an earlier charge and you don't."},
			{id=12378,title="Healer",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:198073|h[Earthshaking Stomp]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to the party.\n$bullet;When Smashspite's Brutality bar fills, he will use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198245|h[Brutal Haymaker]|h|r on the tank, inflicting heavy damage and increasing damage taken for a short time.\n$bullet;Stand between Smashspite and his target to intercept |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198080|h[Hateful Charge]|h|r if they have the debuff from intercepting an earlier charge and you don't."},
			{id=12379,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Stand between Smashspite and his target to intercept |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198080|h[Hateful Charge]|h|r if they have the debuff from intercepting an earlier charge and you don't."},
			{id=12493,title="Section 12"},
			{id=12380,title="Section 5",difficultyIDs={2,8,23,24}},
			{id=12381,title="Section 6"},
			{id=12382,title="Section 7"},
			{id=12383,title="Section 8"},
			{id=12430,title="Call of the Felbat",body="Smashspite calls down a Felbat. The frequency of this ability increases as the encounter continues."},
			{id=12431,title="Section 10"},
			{id=12432,title="Section 11"},
		},
	},
	[1665]={
