		order=2,
		name="Ularogg Cragshaper",
		lore="Ularogg Cragshaper, an ancient drogbar that has committed his life to the pursuit of power. Through violence and deception, Ularogg rose to become the Underking's trusted advisor. He detests Navarogg for bringing \"intruders\" into their home and will take pleasure in bringing about their violent end.",
