		sections={
			{id=12433,title="Overview",body="Ularogg Cragshaper summons Bellowing Idols that cause |cFF2959D3|Hspell:193267|h[Falling Debris]|h|r to damage the party until destroyed. \n\nThroughout the fight, Ularogg hides himself inside a Bellowing Idol during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198510|h[Stance of the Mountain]|h|r, inflicting increasing damage until the idol hiding Ularogg is destroyed."},
			{id=12434,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Destroy Bellowing Idols to stop damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:193267|h[Falling Debris]|h|r."},
			{id=12435,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Damage to the party increases the longer |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198510|h[Stance of the Mountain]|h|r lasts.\n$bullet;Ularogg inflicts massive damage to the tank with his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198496|h[Sunder]|h|r ability."},
			{id=12436,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Ularogg inflicts massive damage with his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198496|h[Sunder]|h|r ability."},
