		},
		sections={
			{id=12518,title="Overview",body="Naraxas emerges from a deep burrow to feed, drawing players towards her maw with her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:199176|h[Spiked Tongue]|h|r. As the fight progresses, additional drogbar jump into the area and run towards Naraxas as sacrifices, granting her stacks of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:199246|h[Ravenous]|h|r.$[!2,23\n\nOn Heroic difficulty, the crowd in the stands begins Hurling Rocks, doing continuous damage to the party.$]"},
			{id=12519,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Kill drogbar before they can be devoured by Naraxas.\n$bullet;Avoid standing in pools of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:210150|h[Toxic Retch]|h|r."},
			{id=12520,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Heal allies hit by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:188492|h[Rancid Maw]|h|r.\n$bullet;Allies consumed by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:199176|h[Spiked Tongue]|h|r take massive damage.",difficultyIDs={1}},
			{id=13910,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Heal allies hit by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:188492|h[Rancid Maw]|h|r.\n$bullet;Allies consumed by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:199176|h[Spiked Tongue]|h|r take massive damage.\n$bullet;The crowd begins |cFF2959D3|Hspell:217011|h[Hurling Rocks]|h|r to damage the party.",difficultyIDs={2,8,23,24}},
			{id=12521,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;If Naraxas is not engaged in melee combat, she damages the entire party with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198963|h[Putrid Skies]|h|r.\n$bullet;Run away from Naraxas when she starts to cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:199176|h[Spiked Tongue]|h|r.\n$bullet;At 20% health, Naraxas goes into a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:199775|h[Frenzy]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={1}},
			{id=13911,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;If Naraxas is not engaged in melee combat, she damages the entire party with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:198963|h[Putrid Skies]|h|r.\n$bullet;Run away from Naraxas when she starts to cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:199176|h[Spiked Tongue]|h|r.\n$bullet;At 20% health, Naraxas goes into a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:199775|h[Frenzy]|h|r.\n$bullet;Pools formed by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:188492|h[Rancid Maw]|h|r can be used to reduce the pull strength of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:199176|h[Spiked Tongue]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={2,8,23,24}},
			{id=12522,title="Naraxas"},
			{id=12523,title="Section 6"},
