		sections={
			{id=12905,title="Overview",body="Players encounter Krosus on a broken section of bridge. Over the course of the encounter, Krosus smashes sections of the bridge, forcing players to retreat into a dwindling space. If Krosus is not defeated in time, players will be left with no foothold, and will plunge into the sea and perish."},
			{id=12906,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;If afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:205348|h[Orb of Destruction]|h|r, move as far away from other players as possible.\n$bullet;Catch nearby |cFF2959D3|Hspell:205420|h[Burning Pitch]|h|r to prevent Burning Embers from being summoned.\n$bullet;Do not stand near tanks during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:205862|h[Slam].|h|r"},
			{id=12907,title="Healers",body="$bullet;If afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:205348|h[Orb of Destruction]|h|r, move as far away from other players as possible.\n$bullet;Catch nearby |cFF2959D3|Hspell:205420|h[Burning Pitch]|h|r to prevent Burning Embers from being summoned.\n$bullet;Do not stand near tanks during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:205862|h[Slam].|h|r"},
