			{itemID=139643,diffs={109},faction=-1},
			{itemID=142559,diffs={110},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=12955,title="Overview",body="The rate at which time flows fluctuates over the course of the encounter. These changes affect players' movement and actions, but the Chronomatic Anomaly is exceptionally sensitive to the flow of time and its abilities may be drastically affected."},
			{id=12956,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Monitor your stacks of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206607|h[Chronometric Particles]|h|r and be aware of any changes in their duration.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:211927|h[Power Overwhelming]|h|r can be interrupted by a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:212109|h[Temporal Smash]|h|r from a Temporal Orb."},
			{id=12957,title="Healers",body="$bullet;You will have significantly different amounts of time to react to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206609|h[Time Release]|h|r based on the the current Passage of Time rate.\n$bullet;Waning Time Particles continually emit raidwide damage via |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207228|h[Warp Nightwell]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:211927|h[Power Overwhelming]|h|r inflicts increasing damage until it is interrupted by a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:212109|h[Temporal Smash]|h|r."},
			{id=12958,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Waning Time Particles and Fragmented Time Particles continually emit raidwide damage via |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207228|h[Warp Nightwell]|h|r unless interrupted.\n$bullet;Defeat Waning Time Particles quickly to allow your tanks to interrupt |cFF2959D3|Hspell:211927|h[Power Overwhelming]|h|r.\n$bullet;Once hit with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:212109|h[Temporal Smash]|h|r the Chronomatic Anomaly will take additional damage."},
			{id=12959,title="Section 9"},
			{id=13063,title="Section 16"},
			{id=13064,title="Section 17"},
			{id=13440,title="Burst of Time"},
			{id=12960,title="Section 5"},
			{id=12962,title="Section 7",difficultyIDs={14,15,16}},
			{id=13019,title="Depleted Time Particle",body="Fires Tachyon Pulses at random enemies.\n$[!16\n\nWhen a Depleted Time Particle dies, it explodes in a Tachyon Burst.$]"},
			{id=13020,title="Section 11"},
			{id=13442,title="Section 22"},
			{id=13288,title="Section 21"},
			{id=13022,title="Waning Time Particle",body="Continually Warps the fabric of time within the Nightwell, damaging all players in the zone.  Leaves behind a Temporal Rift and divides into Fragmented Time Particles on death."},
			{id=13023,title="Section 14",body="$[!15,16\n\nWhen the Waning Time Particle reaches 30% health remaining this ability becomes uninterruptable.$]"},
			{id=13286,title="Section 19"},
			{id=13287,title="Section 20"},
			{id=13289,title="Section 22"},
