			{itemID=143579,diffs={14,15,16},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=12999,title="Overview",body="As the fight progresses, the malfunctioning construct swaps between various modes that determine what abilities it uses.\n\nDuring Cleaner mode, eat |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206788|h[Toxic Slices]|h|r. During Maniac mode, avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:214672|h[Annihilation]|h|r. While Trilliax is in Caretaker mode, hop onto scrubbers when they malfuction to prevent the raid taking damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207327|h[Cleansing Destruction]|h|r.$[!16\n\nOn Mythic difficulty, Trilliax uses Personality Transference to activate additional constructs. When Trilliax's current mode matches the additional construct's, they activate Dual Personalities.$]"},
			{id=13000,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;During Maniac mode, stand close to your partner when connected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:208924|h[Arcing Bonds]|h|r.\n$bullet;During Caretaker mode, jump on Scrubbers when they channel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207327|h[Cleansing Destruction]|h|r.\n$bullet;During Cleaner mode, stand apart from the raid when affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:208506|h[Sterilize]|h|r.",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=13915,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;During Maniac mode, stand close to your partner when connected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:208924|h[Arcing Bonds]|h|r.\n$bullet;During Caretaker mode, jump on Scrubbers when they channel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207327|h[Cleansing Destruction]|h|r.\n$bullet;During Cleaner mode, stand apart from the raid when affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:208506|h[Sterilize]|h|r.\n$bullet,Kill the additional constructs activated by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:214880|h[Personality Transference]|h|r",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=13001,title="Healers",body="$bullet;During Maniac mode, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206645|h[Mana Rupture]|h|r pulses damage to the raid.\n$bullet;During Cleaner mode, heal players affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206788|h[Toxic Slice]|h|r."},
			{id=13002,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Take turns getting hit with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206641|h[Arcane Slash]|h|r.\n$bullet;During Maniac mode, stand close to your partner when connected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:208924|h[Arcing Bonds]|h|r.\n$bullet;During Caretaker mode, jump on Scrubbers when they channel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207327|h[Cleansing Destruction]|h|r.\n$bullet;Steadily move Trilliax around the room to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206482|h[Arcane Seepage]|h|r."},
			{id=13004,title="Section 8"},
			{id=13005,title="Section 9"},
			{id=13471,title="Section 24",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=13879,title="Section 31",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=13880,title="Section 32",difficultyIDs={16}},
