		sections={
			{id=13025,title="Overview",body="Star Augur Etraeus fights within a stellar observatory of his own construction. At 90%, 60%, and 30% health remaining, he will activate his observation deck to project the raid through the nether overlooking different worlds, siphoning the energies of those worlds to empower his abilities in different ways."},
			{id=13026,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Huddle together with clumps of players to remove |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206585|h[Absolute Zero]|h|r, avoiding players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206589|h[Chilled]|h|r.\n$bullet;Use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:208426|h[Fel Impact]|h|r to clear pools of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206399|h[Felflame]|h|r.\n$bullet;If a Thing Which Should Not Be is too close to Etraeus, they will both gain |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207716|h[Void Shift]|h|r.\n$bullet;Turn away from Things Which Should Not Be when they cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207720|h[Witness the Void]|h|r."},
			{id=13027,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Players affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206464|h[Coronal Ejection]|h|r suffer heavy damage over time.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:206517|h[Fel Nova]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207720|h[Witness the Void]|h|r deal heavy raid damage.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:206965|h[Voidburst]|h|r deals increasing damage over time.\n$bullet;Turn away from Things Which Should Not Be when they cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207720|h[Witness the Void]|h|r."},
			{id=13028,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Move away from other players when afflicted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206936|h[Icy Ejection]|h|r to avoid damaging them with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206938|h[Shatter]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid placing |cFF2959D3|Hspell:206399|h[Felflame]|h|r on other players when afflicted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:205649|h[Fel Ejection]|h|r.\n$bullet;Turn away from Things Which Should Not Be when they cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:207720|h[Witness the Void]|h|r."},
			{id=13029,title="Section 5",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=13032,title="Section 8"},
			{id=13033,title="Stage One: The Dome of Observation"},
