			{itemID=141444,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=139547,diffs={42269},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=13422,title="Overview",body="Over the course of the encounter, each of the Soultakers gains energy. As each Soultaker reaches 100 energy, they unleash a devastating attack."},
			{id=13423,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Avoid being caught between Reaver Jdorn and his target during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:213590|h[Seadog's Scuttle]|h|r.\n$bullet;Quickly kill the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:213522|h[Cursed Crewmen]|h|r before Captain Hring completes the cast of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:213533|h[Shatter Crewman]|h|r.\n$bullet;Do not stand in the rifts opened by Soultrapper Mevra during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:213611|h[Soul Rend]|h|r."},
			{id=13424,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Avoid being caught between Reaver Jdorn and his target during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:213590|h[Seadog's Scuttle]|h|r.\n$bullet;Do not stand in the rifts opened by Soultrapper Mevra during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:213611|h[Soul Rend]|h|r."},
			{id=13425,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Avoid being caught between Reaver Jdorn and his target during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:213590|h[Seadog's Scuttle]|h|r.\n$bullet;Quickly gain threat on all of the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:213522|h[Cursed Crewmen]|h|r after they are summoned.\n$bullet;Do not stand in the rifts opened by Soultrapper Mevra during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:213611|h[Soul Rend]|h|r."},
			{id=13426,title="Captain Hring"},
