			{itemID=141517,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=141535,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=142108,diffs={43448},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=13722,title="Overview",body="As the fight progresses, Drugon hurls |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219542|h[Avalanche]|h|r at random enemy target destinations. Targets hit by this ability become |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219812|h[Frozen]|h|r and take increased damage from following attacks."},
			{id=13723,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Avoid standing in front of Drugon during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219602|h[Snow Plow]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid getting hit with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219542|h[Avalanche]|h|r."},
			{id=13724,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Allies affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219812|h[Frozen]|h|r take increased damage from all attacks.\n$bullet;Heal allies being gripped by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219610|h[Snow Plow]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid getting hit by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219542|h[Avalanche]|h|r."},
			{id=13725,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Face Drugon away from allies to avoid hitting them with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219493|h[Snow Crash]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid standing in front of Drugon during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219602|h[Snow Plow]|h|r."},
			{id=13727,title="Section 6"},
