		},
		sections={
			{id=13735,title="Overview",body="Ana-Mouz uses various area-denial abilities to limit where enemies can safely stand. Additionally, she summons Lesser Minions."},
			{id=13736,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Avoid standing in |cFF2959D3|Hspell:218823|h[Fel Geysers]|h|r.\n$bullet;Do not stand in front of the boss during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:218888|h[Impish Flames]|h|r.\n$bullet;Kill Lesser Minions summoned by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219255|h[Gaseous Breath]|h|r."},
			{id=13737,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Face Ana-Mouz away from allies to avoid hitting them with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:218888|h[Impish Flames]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid standing in |cFF2959D3|Hspell:218823|h[Fel Geysers]|h|r."},
			{id=13738,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Avoid standing in |cFF2959D3|Hspell:218823|h[Fel Geysers]|h|r.\n$bullet;Do not stand in front of the boss during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:218888|h[Impish Flames]|h|r.\n$bullet;Dispel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:219045|h[Mother's Embrace]|h|r to prevent your allies from being charmed."},
