			{itemID=142104,diffs={109},faction=-1},
			{itemID=142110,diffs={109},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=13998,title="Overview",body="Odyn challenges players to prove their worth before delving into Helheim to face Helya. Players begin the encounter facing Hymdall and Hyrja. After bringing both Hymdall and Hyrja to 25% health before they can cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell: 228171|h[Revivify]|h|r, Odyn leaps into battle.\n\nAt 55% health remaining, Odyn shows his true power and begins to fill the room with |cFF2959D3|Hspell: 227475|h[Cleansing Flame]|h|r. When Odyn reaches 10% health, he is satisfied with your martial prowess, and allows you to become his champions in the fight against Helya."},
			{id=13999,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;While Hyrja is active, help soak the damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:228162|h[Shield of Light]|h|r.\n$bullet;While Hymdall is active, avoid standing near other players as he casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:228012|h[Horn of Valor]|h|r.\n$bullet;When Odyn casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:227503|h[Draw Power]|h|r, quickly move the Valajrar Runebearers to their matching rune and slay them on it to disable the rune, lowering the damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:227629|h[Unerring Blast]|h|r.\n$bullet;Move away from other players when afflicted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:227959|h[Storm of Justice]|h|r."},
			{id=14000,title="Healers",body="$bullet;While Hyrja is active, help soak the damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:228162|h[Shield of Light]|h|r.\n$bullet;While Hymdall is active, avoid standing near other players as |cFF2959D3|Hspell:228012|h[Horn of Valor]|h|r hits nearby allies.\n$bullet;When Odyn casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:227503|h[Draw Power]|h|r, quickly move the Valajrar Runebearers to their matching rune and slay them on it to disable the rune, lowering the damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:227629|h[Unerring Blast]|h|r.\n$bullet;Move away from other players when afflicted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:227959|h[Storm of Justice]|h|r."},
			{id=14001,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;While Hymdall and Hyrja are active, position them carefully to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:228018|h[Valarjar's Bond]|h|r .\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:227626|h[Odyn's Test]|h|r will stack until Odyn melee attacks a different target.\n$bullet;Move as far away from Odyn as possible while afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:228915|h[Stormforged Spear]|h|r."},
			{id=14002,title="Stage One: Might of the Valarjar"},
			{id=14005,title="Hymdall"},
			{id=14178,title="Section 34"},
			{id=14179,title="Section 34"},
