			{id=14114,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Defeat the Gang Ruffians and Shoreline Tidespeakers first to reduce the danger to your party.\n$bullet;Move away from other party members when |cFF2959D3|Hspell:227780|h[Thunder Ritual]|h|r is about to expire."},
			{id=14115,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Players struck by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:227325|h[Poisonous Shank]|h|r will require extra attention.\n$bullet;Move away from other party members when |cFF2959D3|Hspell:227780|h[Thunder Ritual]|h|r is about to expire."},
