		},
		sections={
			{id=14408,title="Overview",body="Upon reaching 66% and 33% health, Viz'aduum the Watcher will open a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:229610|h[Demonic Portal]|h|r to retreat to a nearby Legion Command Ship."},
			{id=14410,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;During the initial phase, lead the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:229242|h[Fel Beam]|h|r away from your allies.\n$bullet;Avoid taking damage from the Legion Command Ship's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:229284|h[Bombardment]|h|r.\n$bullet;While on a Legion Command Ship, avoid being knocked off by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:229151|h[Disintegrate]|h|r.\n$bullet;In the final phase, prevent |cFF2959D3|Hspell:230084|h[Stabilize Rift]|h|r from completing."},
			{id=14409,title="Healers",body="$bullet;During the initial phase, lead the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:229242|h[Fel Beam]|h|r away from your allies.\n$bullet;Avoid taking damage from the Legion Command Ship's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:229284|h[Bombardment]|h|r.\n$bullet;While on a Legion Command Ship, avoid being knocked off by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:229151|h[Disintegrate]|h|r."},
			{id=14411,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Avoid taking damage from the Legion Command Ship's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:229284|h[Bombardment]|h|r.\n$bullet;While on a Legion Command Ship, avoid being knocked off by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:229151|h[Disintegrate]|h|r.\n$bullet;In the final phase prevent |cFF2959D3|Hspell:230084|h[Stabilize Rift]|h|r from completing."},
			{id=14412,title="Stage One: Netherspace",body="Viz'aduum the Watcher periodically commands the nearby legion ships to assault his enemies."},
