		sections={
			{id=14637,title="Overview",body="Stick together in order to spread out the damage done by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:231854|h[Unchecked Rage]|h|r. Try to keep the amount of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:231770|h[Drenched]|h|r stacks you have low in order to reduce the damage taken from all sources of Frost damage throughout the fight."},
			{id=14638,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Make sure not to get too many stacks of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:231998|h[Jagged Abrasion]|h|r.\n$bullet;Pick up the Razorjaw Wavemenders when they spawn in order to keep them away from the raid."},
			{id=14639,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;When the boss casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:232061|h[Draw In]|h|r, make sure to move to avoid being hit by moving pools of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:231768|h[Drenching Waters]|h|r.\n$bullet;Move out of the impact point of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233526|h[Drenching Slough]|h|r to avoid taking unnecessary damage or stacks of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:231770|h[Drenched]|h|r."},
			{id=14640,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Raid-wide healing is a top priority each time the boss casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:231854|h[Unchecked Rage]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:232174|h[Frosty Discharge]|h|r.\n$bullet;Move out of the impact point of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233526|h[Drenching Slough]|h|r to avoid taking unnecessary damage or stacks of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:231770|h[Drenched]|h|r."},
