			{itemID=147190,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=14641,title="Overview",body="Atrigan and Belac share health.\n\nBoth Atrigan and Belac's abilities all inflict |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233104|h[Torment]|h|r. Reaching full |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233104|h[Torment]|h|r results in |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233430|h[Unbearable Torment]|h|r."},
			{id=14642,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:233652|h[Confess]|h|r when at full |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233104|h[Torment]|h|r to collect Remnants of Hope from Belac's cage and alleviate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233430|h[Unbearable Torment]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid attacking Atrigan and Belac during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233441|h[Bone Saw]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:235230|h[Fel Squall]|h|r respectively, so you don't incur additional |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233104|h[Torment]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid standing near allies when afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233983|h[Echoing Anguish]|h|r.\n$bullet;Interrupt |cFF2959D3|Hspell:239401|h[Pangs of Guilt]|h|r!"},
			{id=14643,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:233652|h[Confess]|h|r when at full |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233104|h[Torment]|h|r to collect Remnants of Hope from Belac's cage and alleviate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233430|h[Unbearable Torment]|h|r.\n$bullet;Stagger dispelling |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233983|h[Echoing Anguish]|h|r to spread out the damage caused by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:239358|h[Anguished Outburst]|h|r."},
			{id=14644,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:233652|h[Confess]|h|r when at full |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233104|h[Torment]|h|r to collect Remnants of Hope from Belac's cage and alleviate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233430|h[Unbearable Torment]|h|r.\n$bullet;Coordinate with the other tank so only one has to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233652|h[Confess]|h|r at a time.\n$bullet;Avoid attacking Atrigan and Belac during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233441|h[Bone Saw]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:235230|h[Fel Squall]|h|r respectively, so you don't incur additional |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233104|h[Torment]|h|r."},
			{id=14698,title="Section 11"},
			{id=14699,title="Section 12"},
			{id=14700,title="Section 13"},
