			{itemID=140889,diffs={17},faction=-1},
			{itemID=140805,diffs={17},faction=-1},
			{itemID=140890,diffs={17},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=14659,title="Overview",body="Grand Magistrix Elisande harness the power of the Nightwell to shape time itself. When her health is low and she is nearing defeat, she rewinds time to send players back to the point at which they first engaged her. The fight recommences from this point, but Elisande uses new abilities mixed in with echoes of her past actions. She can perform this feat twice, after which time can no longer save her."},
			{id=14660,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:210022|h[Epocheric Orb]|h|r damages the entire raid if allowed to strike the ground.\n$bullet;Expedient Elementals continually damage the raid with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:209568|h[Exothermic Release]|h|r until they are dispatched. This damage increases with each successful cast."},
			{id=14661,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:210022|h[Epocheric Orb]|h|r damages the entire raid if allowed to strike the ground.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:229738|h[Cascadent Star]|h|r will damage a large portion of the raid."},
			{id=14662,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;In each time layer, Elisande employs a different ability to threaten tanks.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:209973|h[Ablating Explosion]|h|r inflicts falloff damage to the entire raid when it expires.\n$bullet;Interrupt |cFF2959D3|Hspell:209971|h[Ablative Pulse]|h|r."},
			{id=14663,title="Section 27"},
			{id=14664,title="Section 32"},
			{id=14665,title="Time Elementals",body="Grand Magistrix periodically summons Time Elementals to aid her in combat. When these elementals are dispatched they leave behind a rift that persists until they are consumed."},
			{id=14666,title="Recursive Elemental",body="When this elemental dies it leaves behind a zone of Slow Time."},
			{id=14667,title="Section 29"},
			{id=14668,title="Section 28"},
			{id=14669,title="Inexorant"},
			{id=14670,title="Expedient Elemental",body="When this elemental dies it leaves behind a zone of  Fast Time."},
			{id=14671,title="Burst"},
			{id=14672,title="Section 22"},
			{id=14673,title="Time Layer 1",body="While in this Time Layer Grand Magistrix Elisande will use her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:209168|hSpanning Singularity|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:208807|hArcanetic Ring|h|r abilities."},
			{id=14674,title="Section 6",body="$[!14,15,16,17\n\nThis ability echoes.$]\n$[!16\n\nIn Mythic Difficulty, the Arcanetic Ring expands to the outside of the room after collapsing.$]"},
			{id=14675,title="Section 10",body="$[!14,15,16,17\n\nSpanning Singularities appear at the same time and place in successive Time Layers.$]"},
			{id=14676,title="Section 23"},
			{id=14677,title="Time Layer 2",body="While in this Time Layer Grand Magistrix Elisande will use her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:210022|hEpocheric Orb|h|r ability."},
			{id=14678,title="Epochera",body="$[!14,15,16,17\n\nThis ability echoes.$]\n$[!16\n\nIn Mythic difficulty, players catching the Orbs are afflicted with Epocheric Vulnerability.$]"},
			{id=14679,title="Section 23"},
			{id=14680,title="Time Layer 3",body="While in this Time Layer Grand Magistrix Elisande will use her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:209242|hDelphuric Beam|h|r ability."},
			{id=14681,title="Section 23"},
			{id=14682,title="Section 12",body="$[!16\n\nThis ability echoes in Mythic difficulty, and the beam continues through the target rather than stopping at the target.$]"},
		},
	},
	[1873]={
		encounterID=1873,
		instanceID=875,
		order=8,
		name="Fallen Avatar",
		lore="When Aegwynn defeated the Avatar of Sargeras, she was unable to destroy his avatar. In an effort to seal it away, the armor was entombed beneath the Temple of Elune, where it remained dormant for hundreds of years. Now, with the Legion tearing down the tomb's barriers, Kil'jaeden is in a position to reanimate the armor and unleash its power on Azeroth.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2038,
		uiMapID=854,
		pin={x=0.505,y=0.1883},
		difficultyIDs={14,15,16,17},
		npcIDs={116939},
		displayIDs={74497,74498},
		loot={
