			{id=14806,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Dodge |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233971|h[Tidal Wave]|h|r by watching the sea for incoming waves.\n$bullet;Avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:234231|h[Submerge]|h|r stuns, especially as waves crash over the beach."},
			{id=14808,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Dodge |cFF2959D3|Hspell:233971|h[Tidal Wave]|h|r by watching the sea for incoming waves.\n$bullet;Gather the Si'vashi Honor Guard before they harm your allies."},
