			{id=15919,title="Overview",body="Viceroy Nezhar creates a ring of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1263529|h[Collapsing Void]|h|r that becomes a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1263532|h[Void Storm]|h|r. Nezhar also blasts players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1263542|h[Mass Void Infusion]|h|r that leaves behind void energy.\n\nUmbral Tentacles answer the viceroy's call and attacks players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1268733|h[Mind Flay]|h|r."},
			{id=15920,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265030|h[Void Storm]|h|r inflicts heavy Shadow damage to players caught within it.\n$bullet;Umbral Tentacles channel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1268733|h[Mind Flay]|h|r on a random player."},
