		sections={
			{id=15996,title="Overview",body="L'ura summons |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265419|h[Notes of Despair]|h|r that continue to play |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265421|h[Dirge of Despair]|h|r until they are destroyed. L'ura occasionally targets players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265464|h[Discordant Beam]|h|r that inflicts heavy Shadow damage and also silences any |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265419|h[Notes of Despair]|h|r it hits.\n\nWhen all the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265419|h[Notes of Despair]|h|r are silenced, Alleria destroys them with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1266643|h[Shattering Shot]|h|r."},
			{id=15997,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265464|h[Discordant Beam]|h|r inflicts heavy Shadow damage to each targeted player and silences any |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265419|h[Notes of Despair]|h|r it hits.\n$bullet; Alleria's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265999|h[Siphon Void]|h|r causes L'ura to take massively increased damage."},
			{id=15998,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265421|h[Dirge of Despair]|h|r continues to damage all players until all |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265419|h[Notes of Despair]|h|r are silenced.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265464|h[Discordant Beam]|h|r inflicts heavy Shadow damage to each targeted player and silences any |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265419|h[Notes of Despair]|h|r it hits."},
			{id=15999,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Each |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1267207|h[Abyssal Lance]|h|r inflicts Shadow damage to the target player.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265464|h[Discordant Beam]|h|r inflicts heavy Shadow damage to each targeted player and silences any |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1265419|h[Notes of Despair]|h|r it hits."},
