			{itemID=152373,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=16259,title="Overview",body="Occularus will attack his threat target with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:247318|h[Gushing Wounds]|h|r, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:247320|h[Searing Gaze]|h|r, and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:247325|h[Lashes]|h|r.  All the while, Occularus will periodically afflict random enemies with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:247332|h[Eye Sores]|h|r and confound enemy positioning with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:247393|h[Phantasms]|h|r."},
			{id=16260,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:247393|h[Phantasms]|h|r can be avoided, but their movement is deceptive.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:247320|h[Searing Gaze]|h|r can be interrupted."},
			{id=16261,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:247393|h[Phantasms]|h|r can be avoided, but their movement is deceptive.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:247332|h[Eye Sores]|h|r will decimate your raid if the victims are not healed.\n$bullet;Tanks will take more and more damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:247318|h[Gushing Wounds]|h|r the longer they continue to tank Occularus."},
			{id=16262,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:247393|h[Phantasms]|h|r can be avoided, but their movement is deceptive.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:247320|h[Searing Gaze]|h|r can be interrupted.\n$bullet;Alternate tanking the boss to mitigate the effects of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:247318|h[Gushing Wound]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:247325|h[Lash]|h|r."},
